  "descriptions": {
    "en": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "An R package that provides functions for 3D tessellation with Voro++ and subsequent horizontal cutting of the resulting polygons for 2D plotting. It was developed for archaeological spatiotemporal data, but may as well be used for other three dimensional contexts."
    }
  },
